# STEP 2 - Select Tool

Drag a **Select Tool**

Purpose

* Remove unnecessary columns
* Rename columns
* Arrange columns

Keep only

```
Ticker
Company Name
Account#
Type
Cash Balance
Date
```

Rename

```
