# STEP 3 - Create Age Column

Drag a **Formula Tool**

Create new column

```
Age
```

Datatype

```
Int32
```

Formula

If Date is already Date datatype

```alteryx
DateTimeDiff(DateTimeToday(), [Date], "days")
```

If Date is string

```alteryx
DateTimeDiff(
DateTimeToday(),
DateTimeParse([Date],"%m-%d-%y"),
"days")
```

Example

Today's date

```
02-Jul-2026
```

Input Date

```
30-Jun-2026
```

Output

```
2
```

---

# STEP 4 - Create Age Group

Again add another **Formula Tool**

Create column

```
Age Group
```

Datatype

```
String
```

Formula

```alteryx
IF [Age] >=1 AND [Age]<=7 THEN "1 - 7"

ELSEIF [Age]>=8 AND [Age]<=30 THEN "8 - 30"

ELSEIF [Age]>=31 AND [Age]<=60 THEN "31 - 60"

ELSEIF [Age]>=61 AND [Age]<=90 THEN "61 - 90"

ELSEIF [Age]>=91 AND [Age]<=180 THEN "91 - 180"

ELSEIF [Age]>=181 AND [Age]<=365 THEN "181 - 365"

ELSE "> 365"

ENDIF
```

Example

Age

```
48
```

Output

```
31 - 60
```

Age

```
5
```

Output

```
1 - 7
```

Age

```
1457
```

Output

```
>365
```

